# Success Criteria

The exercise is successful when:

Average power increases.

Power drop-off decreases.

Heart rate recovery improves.

Training quality remains high.

Combat conditioning improves without excessive orthopedic fatigue.

---

# Final Principle

The Assault Bike allows athletes to train at maximal intensity

without maximal impact.

It develops the engine that sustains explosive combat performance,

while preserving the joints needed to express it.